==Description==
The '''SandCastle Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 4 of the premium [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{BeachBalls|180}} or {{Robux|84}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|700}} or {{Robux|406}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|84}} with a total cost of {{Robux|406}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a cost of {{Robux|44}}, with a total cost of {{Robux|366}}.

The '''SandCastle Nametag''' has pink text with a dark pink outline and a sand background. Various starfish appear on the text. Above the text, there is a layer of sand, on which a sandcastle is built.

